        "original_id": "d45033d3-e365-5d87-97b7-b60b680dad94",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Pirner, Les McKeown, Harvey Shield, Butch Vig\n- Bands: Soul Asylum, Bay City Rollers\n- Songs: Just Like Anyone, The Way I Feel Tonight\n- Roles: lead vocalist, frontman, lead singer, songwriter, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Pirner was born on April 16, 1964.\n- Les McKeown was born on November 12, 1955.\n- Dave Pirner is an American songwriter, singer, and producer.\n- Dave Pirner is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman of the alternative rock band Soul Asylum.\n- Les McKeown is a Scottish pop singer.\n- Les McKeown was the lead singer of the Bay City Rollers during the band's most successful period.\n- Dave Pirner wrote the song \"Just Like Anyone.\"\n- \"Just Like Anyone\" was produced by the band with Butch Vig.\n- \"Just Like Anyone\" was released as the second single from its album.\n- Harvey Shield wrote \"The Way I Feel Tonight.\"\n- Les McKeown performed the lead vocal on \"The Way I Feel Tonight.\"\n- \"The Way I Feel Tonight\" is a slow, dramatic ballad with a heavily orchestrated arrangement.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
